{"3700130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TELLURICENE", "steam_appid": 3700130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4726500, 4726860], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/ac2fbc8b6a0d75f2bf3fe72532cd160f.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/ac2fbc8b6a0d75f2bf3fe72532cd160f.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  LOVE IS DECEPTION, GERMINATED IN DESPERATION  ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/e98b9b367303a97eb4baddb65b6c810d.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/e98b9b367303a97eb4baddb65b6c810d.mp4?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome Researcher,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An emerging species is taking root—preternatural, highly intelligent, and swiftly spreading. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classified as the <i>Vivus glomerorum</i>, these new lifeforms threaten to infiltrate our resilient nation. It’s up to our bravest and brightest minds—like you—to investigate and decide: friend or foe? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been selected to conduct scientific studies to piece together the truth behind the <i>V. glomerorum</i>. In the wake of a looming <i><strong>TELLURICENE</strong></i>, you will have an intensive ten days to decide whether this new era comes to fruition or is forever halted. Your great nation thanks you for volunteering in <i><strong>Project Sporesight</strong></i>. May we endure under your guiding hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/93b6984cbfe4a9815fd9b61fafd72081.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/93b6984cbfe4a9815fd9b61fafd72081.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  DO NOT BE DECEIVED  ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/d1932ba0501f7a97a6cc8a2ec705b4b9.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=873 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/d1932ba0501f7a97a6cc8a2ec705b4b9.webm?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/032fbd8ac07705482b103b52a79bd266.webp?t=1782802871\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/032fbd8ac07705482b103b52a79bd266.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=873 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/0b9642ced772d5cc31e8090b1cc13aa3.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/0b9642ced772d5cc31e8090b1cc13aa3.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  ADAPTATION IN ACTION   ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/f5537418676d106828a5eb0aadc554b1.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/f5537418676d106828a5eb0aadc554b1.webm?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/f5537418676d106828a5eb0aadc554b1.mp4?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor a V. glomerorum specimen through three distinct stages—<strong>each with unique physical forms and psychological profiles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be wary, Researcher. Your choices have consequences. Maneuver high-stakes relationships where trust, secrecy, and your choices shape two major romance paths with multiple possible outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  DESIGN YOUR RESEARCHER  ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/4ec497701ae13a8ea0e837d978e62aaa.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/4ec497701ae13a8ea0e837d978e62aaa.webm?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/4ec497701ae13a8ea0e837d978e62aaa.mp4?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead groundbreaking discoveries as one of the EPPA's Volunteer Researchers: </strong>a thoughtful and perceptive mind at the forefront of scientific progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set your pronouns, input your name, design your character, and prepare for a dangerous undertaking, as you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate critical decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the incoming data with your personal ethics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the rigid demands of the project itself </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  AN IMMERSIVE EXPERIENCE  ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/ea1b9c52b2e95607f7bf51d797ea15a1.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/ea1b9c52b2e95607f7bf51d797ea15a1.webm?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/ea1b9c52b2e95607f7bf51d797ea15a1.mp4?t=1782802871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize an interactive research portal to log your findings, review classified data, and submit scientific reports that will determine the fate of V. glomerorum and all Sechians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story-rich world includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130,000 words of seamless lore and worldbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed and handcrafted CGs, sprites, and backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original atmospheric soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/67a98c3382b3a3f9da4ed7afb597159e.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/ac2fbc8b6a0d75f2bf3fe72532cd160f.avif?t=1782802871\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras_big/ac2fbc8b6a0d75f2bf3fe72532cd160f.webp?t=1782802871 width=1560 height=132 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>⏵  LOVE IS DECEPTION, GERMINATED IN DESPERATION  ⏴</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/e98b9b367303a97eb4baddb65b6c810d.poster.avif?t=1782802871\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700130/extras/e98b9b3673